,[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"idPrefix"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Generated"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prefix for renderer-owned document IDs"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderSvg"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartSvgRenderer<TDatum, TXValue, TYValue>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderChartSvg"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Scene-to-SVG renderer"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"measureText"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartTextMeasurer"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Host measurer"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Guide text measurement"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onFocusChange"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(point: ChartPoint | null) => void"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"None"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Primary focus callback"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onFocusGroupChange"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(points: readonly ChartPoint[]) => void"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"None"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Grouped focus callback"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSelect"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(point: ChartPoint | null) => void"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"None"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pointer or keyboard activation callback"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onRender"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(context: ChartRenderContext) => void"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"None"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default SVG, complete surface, container, and scene after rendering"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"class"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"None"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extra class on the outer "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".ts-chart-host"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"style"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StyleValue"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"None"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Outer host style"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"className"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"None"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extra class on the rendered chart surface"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"In templates, camel-cased props may use kebab case: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"aria-label"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"initial-width"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"on-focus-change"},{"type":"text","value":" map to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ariaLabel"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"initialWidth"},{"type":"text","value":", and\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onFocusChange"},{"type":"text","value":". Listener syntax such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@focus-change=\"handleFocus\""},{"type":"text","value":" supplies\nthe callback prop. The component does not forward unrelated attributes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tooltip-body-slot","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tooltip body slot"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The optional "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"#tooltipBody"},{"type":"text","value":" scoped slot receives "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"points"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"content"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultBody"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pinned"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"dismiss"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<Chart :definition=\"definition\" aria-label=\"Revenue\">\n  <template #tooltipBody=\"{ points, defaultBody, pinned, dismiss }\">\n    <component :is=\"defaultBody\" />\n    <SeriesDetail :points=\"points\" />\n    <button v-if=\"pinned\" type=\"button\" @click=\"dismiss\">Close</button>\n  </template>\n</Chart>","lang":"vue"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultBody"},{"type":"text","value":" is a zero-argument Vue functional component containing the\nnative title, rows, formatting, and swatches. Ordering, anchoring, placement,\nportaling, and pinning remain in the definition."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"exported-types","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Exported types"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartCommonProps"},{"type":"text","value":" contains the common host and presentation props.\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartProps"},{"type":"text","value":" adds the definition. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartPresentationProps"},{"type":"text","value":" contains "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"class"},{"type":"text","value":"\nand "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"style"},{"type":"text","value":". "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartTooltipBodySlotContext"},{"type":"text","value":" describes the scoped slot. The\npackage also re-exports "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartDefinition"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartPoint"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"../adapter.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue adapter"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for lifecycle and SSR behavior,\n"},{"type":"link","href":"../../../reference/focus-and-interaction.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Focus and interaction"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for\ncallback semantics, and "},{"type":"link","href":"../../../reference/rendering-and-export.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rendering and export"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\nfor custom SVG renderers."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"props","text":"Props","level":2},{"id":"tooltip-body-slot","text":"Tooltip body slot","level":2},{"id":"exported-types","text":"Exported types","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nimport { Chart } from '@tanstack/charts/vue'\n```\n\nThe definition infers datum and coordinate types for every callback. Replace\nits identity when captured application values change.\nIt also owns `focus`, `focusRing`, `cursor`, `tooltip`, `svgAnimation`, `keyboard`,\n`maxFocusDistance`, and `spatialIndex`.\n\n## Props\n\n| Prop                 | Type                                         | Default               | Meaning                                                             |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `definition`         | `ChartDefinition`                            | Required              | Framework-neutral chart definition                                  |\n| `ariaLabel`          | `string`                                     | Required              | Accessible chart name                                               |\n| `ariaDescription`    | `string`                                     | None                  | Optional accessible description                                     |\n| `height`             | `number`                                     | `320` without a ratio | Fixed CSS and scene height                                          |\n| `aspectRatio`        | `number`                                     | None                  | Positive width-to-height ratio when height is absent                |\n| `width`              | `number`                                     | Responsive            | Fixed CSS and scene width                                           |\n| `initialWidth`       | `number`                                     | `640`                 | Initial and server width before responsive measurement              |\n| `tabIndex`           | `number`                                     | `0`                   | Surface tab index; `keyboard: false` forces `-1`                    |\n| `idPrefix`           | `string`                                     | Generated             | Prefix for renderer-owned document IDs                              |\n| `renderSvg`          | `ChartSvgRenderer<TDatum, TXValue, TYValue>` | `renderChartSvg`      | Scene-to-SVG renderer                                               |\n| `measureText`        | `ChartTextMeasurer`                          | Host measurer         | Guide text measurement                                              |\n| `onFocusChange`      | `(point: ChartPoint \\| null) => void`        | None                  | Primary focus callback                                              |\n| `onFocusGroupChange` | `(points: readonly ChartPoint[]) => void`    | None                  | Grouped focus callback                                              |\n| `onSelect`           | `(point: ChartPoint \\| null) => void`        | None                  | Pointer or keyboard activation callback                             |\n| `onRender`           | `(context: ChartRenderContext) => void`      | None                  | Default SVG, complete surface, container, and scene after rendering |\n| `class`              | `string`                                     | None                  | Extra class on the outer `.ts-chart-host`                           |\n| `style`              | `StyleValue`                                 | None                  | Outer host style                                                    |\n| `className`          | `string`                                     | None                  | Extra class on the rendered chart surface                           |\n\nIn templates, camel-cased props may use kebab case: `aria-label`,\n`initial-width`, and `on-focus-change` map to `ariaLabel`, `initialWidth`, and\n`onFocusChange`. Listener syntax such as `@focus-change=\"handleFocus\"` supplies\nthe callback prop. The component does not forward unrelated attributes.\n\n## Tooltip body slot\n\nThe optional `#tooltipBody` scoped slot receives `points`, `content`,\n`defaultBody`, `pinned`, and `dismiss`:\n\n```vue\n<Chart :definition=\"definition\" aria-label=\"Revenue\">\n  <template #tooltipBody=\"{ points, defaultBody, pinned, dismiss }\">\n    <component :is=\"defaultBody\" />\n    <SeriesDetail :points=\"points\" />\n    <button v-if=\"pinned\" type=\"button\" @click=\"dismiss\">Close</button>\n  </template>\n</Chart>\n```\n\n`defaultBody` is a zero-argument Vue functional component containing the\nnative title, rows, formatting, and swatches. Ordering, anchoring, placement,\nportaling, and pinning remain in the definition.\n\n## Exported types\n\n`ChartCommonProps` contains the common host and presentation props.\n`ChartProps` adds the definition. `ChartPresentationProps` contains `class`\nand `style`. `ChartTooltipBodySlotContext` describes the scoped slot. The\npackage also re-exports `ChartDefinition` and `ChartPoint`.\n\nSee the [Vue adapter](../adapter.md) for lifecycle and SSR behavior,\n[Focus and interaction](../../../reference/focus-and-interaction.md) for\ncallback semantics, and [Rendering and export](../../../reference/rendering-and-export.md)\nfor custom SVG renderers.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Vue Chart\ndescription: Complete prop and type reference for the @tanstack/charts/vue Chart component.\n---\n\n```ts\nimport { Chart } from '@tanstack/charts/vue'\n```\n\nThe definition infers datum and coordinate types for every callback. Replace\nits identity when captured application values change.\nIt also owns `focus`, `focusRing`, `cursor`, `tooltip`, `svgAnimation`, `keyboard`,\n`maxFocusDistance`, and `spatialIndex`.\n\n## Props\n\n| Prop                 | Type                                         | Default               | Meaning                                                             |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `definition`         | `ChartDefinition`                            | Required              | Framework-neutral chart definition                                  |\n| `ariaLabel`          | `string`                                     | Required              | Accessible chart name                                               |\n| `ariaDescription`    | `string`                                     | None                  | Optional accessible description                                     |\n| `height`             | `number`                                     | `320` without a ratio | Fixed CSS and scene height                                          |\n| `aspectRatio`        | `number`                                     | None                  | Positive width-to-height ratio when height is absent                |\n| `width`              | `number`                                     | Responsive            | Fixed CSS and scene width                                           |\n| `initialWidth`       | `number`                                     | `640`                 | Initial and server width before responsive measurement              |\n| `tabIndex`           | `number`                                     | `0`                   | Surface tab index; `keyboard: false` forces `-1`                    |\n| `idPrefix`           | `string`                                     | Generated             | Prefix for renderer-owned document IDs                              |\n| `renderSvg`          | `ChartSvgRenderer<TDatum, TXValue, TYValue>` | `renderChartSvg`      | Scene-to-SVG renderer                                               |\n| `measureText`        | `ChartTextMeasurer`                          | Host measurer         | Guide text measurement                                              |\n| `onFocusChange`      | `(point: ChartPoint \\| null) => void`        | None                  | Primary focus callback                                              |\n| `onFocusGroupChange` | `(points: readonly ChartPoint[]) => void`    | None                  | Grouped focus callback                                              |\n| `onSelect`           | `(point: ChartPoint \\| null) => void`        | None                  | Pointer or keyboard activation callback                             |\n| `onRender`           | `(context: ChartRenderContext) => void`      | None                  | Default SVG, complete surface, container, and scene after rendering |\n| `class`              | `string`                                     | None                  | Extra class on the outer `.ts-chart-host`                           |\n| `style`              | `StyleValue`                                 | None                  | Outer host style                                                    |\n| `className`          | `string`                                     | None                  | Extra class on the rendered chart surface                           |\n\nIn templates, camel-cased props may use kebab case: `aria-label`,\n`initial-width`, and `on-focus-change` map to `ariaLabel`, `initialWidth`, and\n`onFocusChange`. Listener syntax such as `@focus-change=\"handleFocus\"` supplies\nthe callback prop. The component does not forward unrelated attributes.\n\n## Tooltip body slot\n\nThe optional `#tooltipBody` scoped slot receives `points`, `content`,\n`defaultBody`, `pinned`, and `dismiss`:\n\n```vue\n<Chart :definition=\"definition\" aria-label=\"Revenue\">\n  <template #tooltipBody=\"{ points, defaultBody, pinned, dismiss }\">\n    <component :is=\"defaultBody\" />\n    <SeriesDetail :points=\"points\" />\n    <button v-if=\"pinned\" type=\"button\" @click=\"dismiss\">Close</button>\n  </template>\n</Chart>\n```\n\n`defaultBody` is a zero-argument Vue functional component containing the\nnative title, rows, formatting, and swatches. Ordering, anchoring, placement,\nportaling, and pinning remain in the definition.\n\n## Exported types\n\n`ChartCommonProps` contains the common host and presentation props.\n`ChartProps` adds the definition. `ChartPresentationProps` contains `class`\nand `style`. `ChartTooltipBodySlotContext` describes the scoped slot. The\npackage also re-exports `ChartDefinition` and `ChartPoint`.\n\nSee the [Vue adapter](../adapter.md) for lifecycle and SSR behavior,\n[Focus and interaction](../../../reference/focus-and-interaction.md) for\ncallback semantics, and [Rendering and export](../../../reference/rendering-and-export.md)\nfor custom SVG renderers.\n"}
